          "code": "T002",
          "message": "Expected Nat, got Int. Subtracting from a Nat gives an Int, because the result may be below zero. If the value can go below zero, change Nat to Int in its declaration. For machine state, keep a finite range, for example `state count: Int in 0..3 = 0;`.",
